s02_su3_2dcert.log -- S02: SU(3) 2D Weyl gap 区间 (r12 框架)
============================================================================================================

[A] g(d) = -2 log[sin(d/2)/(d/2)] 的严格界
    级数: log(sin x/x) = -sum_{n>=1} c_n x^{2n},  c_n = zeta(2n)/(n pi^{2n}),  x=d/2
    系数正, zeta(2n) in [1, zeta(2)] => 部分和给下界; 尾部用显式界:
      R_N(x) <= (pi^2/3) * (1/(N+1)) * (x/pi)^{2N+2} / (1-(x/pi)^2)
